<section id="how" style="background:var(--bg-soft)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow center"><span class="dot"></span> Simple by design</div>
      <h2>From dirty to done in 4 steps</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps reveal-stagger">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h4>Charge it up</h4>
        <p>Plug in the USB-C cable for 3 hours to get a full 120 minutes of cleaning power.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h4>Click a head</h4>
        <p>Snap on the right brush head for the surface — tile, tub, kitchen, car or window.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h4>Pick a mode</h4>
        <p>Choose Eco, Standard or Turbo depending on how stubborn the grime is.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">04</div>
        <h4>Glide &amp; shine</h4>
        <p>Let the spinning head do the scrubbing — just guide it across the surface.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

